{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショックだった話"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対22日にbirthdayライブのblog投稿しようと思って、めっちゃ急いで書いたの、\nでも私blog書くのめっちゃ時間かかるし、\n帰ってきたの遅くて時間なかったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11時59分になって、ヤバイヤバイ\nってめっちゃ焦って、もうデコレーションもしなくて、で、急いで投稿したの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、次の日、blog確認したら23日になってて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0時00分って書いたあって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スッゴクショックだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもお決まりの最後のBYE 抜けてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スゴクショックだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一周年ライブ、\n皆が苦労したのはきっと、早着替えや立ち位置だと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回衣装チェンジが物凄く沢山あって、\n早着替えだらけで、一曲の半分踊ったら半分着替えてすぐ出る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで、リハーサルは、ちょーギリギリで、リボンがつけれなかったり、スカート違うのを履いたりで、大変でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本番では出来たのでよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち位置もいつもと違って、沢山移動があったりも覚えるのも大変だったけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆のおかげで本当に素敵なライブになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいた方も居たのですが、\n本番、水玉模様を踊ってる時、\n傘を持ってパフォーマンスしたのですが、衣装に傘の骨が引っ掛かって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傘折れたんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃくちゃ恥ずかしかったんですけどそのまま踊りました(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もう１つ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんに顔に紙吹雪みたいなのをペタペタはられて楽しく遊んでたんだけど...実は今から言うのはまいやんも知らないんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっそりまいやんの後ろ髪に紙吹雪を付けたの〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、そのまま挨拶にまいやんは行ってしまったから、紙を着けたままだったんだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんは知らないから、これを読んでたらばれちゃう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんは美人だし、本当に素敵なお姉ちゃまだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又誰かにイタズラしちゃおうかなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのMCでも、あったように、私背が延びたそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスの先生に、ライブ終わり、ハイタッチしたときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『確かに大きくなったね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度身長測ってみようと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに似てるって言われる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも髪切る前の事だけどどう！？\n似てなくてもまりかちゃん可愛いから似てると言ってね(^.^)汗(^^;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な心のこもったコメントありがとう\nございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に毎回読むのが楽しみですー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはこの１年でどう変わったかな〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が思うまあやってどんな子なの？？\n以上\n最近ホイップにめっちゃはまってるまあやでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}